title: Prussia Votes
subtitle: The first election for the united party.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: year = 1921 and month = 2 and e21_prussia_done = 0 and congress = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 11
on-arrival: e21_prussia_done = 1; e21_prussia_bonus = 0

= Prussia Votes

On 20 February Prussia, two thirds of Germany, elects its Landtag. It is the first test of the [+ e21_party +]. The campaign is short and cold. Our speakers are shouted down in the Catholic Rhineland and cheered in the Mansfeld copper towns.

[? if election_boycott = 1 : The party line is to boycott the parliaments, so our speakers will tell the workers not to vote. ?][? if election_boycott = 0 : The Zentrale must decide what the campaign is about. ?]

- @bread: Bread, wages and the price of coal.
- @soviets: Soviet Russia and the councils.

@bread
subtitle: Wins votes among workers who have never read a communist paper.
on-arrival: worker_support += 3; lean_unionist += 1; e21_prussia_bonus = 0.8
go-to: result

@soviets
subtitle: Fewer votes, and a party in fighting spirit in Halle and Berlin.
on-arrival: {!
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
Q.e21_prussia_bonus = -0.4;
RG.district('halle', {militancy: 6});
RG.district('berlin', {militancy: 5});
!}
go-to: result

@result
title: The Result
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
// the Prussian Landtag of 1921 as it was elected: 428 seats
var base = (Q.vkpd_formed == 1)
    ? {spd: 114, zentrum: 81, dnvp: 75, dvp: 58, ddp: 26, uspd: 28, kpd: 31}
    : {spd: 114, zentrum: 81, dnvp: 75, dvp: 58, ddp: 26, uspd: 50, kpd: 9};
var r = RG.election('prussia', {base: base, size: 428, kpdShare: (Q.vkpd_formed == 1) ? 7.4 : 2.4,
    bonus: Q.e21_prussia_bonus, news: false});
Q.e21_prussia_seats = r.kpd_seats;
Q.e21_prussia_share = Q.election_kpd_share_display;
Q.e21_prussia_spd = r.seats.spd || 0;
Q.e21_prussia_better = (Q.vkpd_formed == 1) ? (r.kpd_seats >= 36 ? 1 : (r.kpd_seats <= 25 ? 2 : 0)) : 0;
if (r.kpd_share > 0) {
    RG.news('Prussia votes: Communists win ' + Q.election_kpd_share_display + ' per cent and ' + r.kpd_seats + ' seats', 3);
}
!}

[? if election_kpd_seats > 0 : The [+ e21_party +] wins [+ e21_prussia_share +] per cent of the vote and [+ e21_prussia_seats +] of the 428 seats. The SPD, with [+ e21_prussia_spd +], is still the strongest party in Prussia, and the next coalition will be formed without us. ?][? if election_kpd_seats = 0 : The party stands no candidates, and the Landtag is elected without a single communist in it. ?]

[? if e21_prussia_better = 1 : It is more than anyone in the Zentrale dared to hope. ?][? if e21_prussia_better = 2 : Many of the Independents who came over in December did not bring their voters with them. ?]
